{"slug":"GROW-A-67-fast-orb-farm-76171","_id":"6945367b40dfcbc2b72f51f3","title":"fast orb farm","game":{"_id":"6945367b40dfcbc2b72f51f0","gameId":108139974584424,"name":"💥GROW A 67","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":108139974584424},"features":"What does the script do?:\n- It gets all the IDs of the orbs currently on the client\n- Eats them all with a small cooldown, and repeats\n\nTips:\n- Enter the playing field before starting the script\n- If you want to do AFK farming, I recommend using cfly to go to a zone where they can't eat you","tags":["fast","autofarm","orb","farm","money"],"script":"local orbFolder = game.Workspace.ClientOrbs\nlocal orbEated = 0\n\nwhile true do\n  task.wait()\n\n  for _, v in pairs(orbFolder:GetChildren()) do\n    if orbEated >= 15 then -- (I already tried to do it faster, but it seems to get stuck.)\n      task.wait()\n      orbEated = 0\n    end\n    \n    local orbName = v.Name:gsub(\"^Orb_\", \"\")\n    local orbId = tonumber(orbName)\n    \n    if not orbId then continue end\n\n    game:GetService(\"ReplicatedStorage\").Events.OrbCollected:FireServer({ orbId })\n    orbEated += 1\n    end\nend","owner":{"_id":"689f6919909f04486bb028db","username":"nf7_","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/b4488c294a971e46e2c31019c39457f1f5653e1b52334bfc6f18a00b3842a7ab.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/689f6919909f04486bb028db-1755277710119.jpeg"},"status":"offline","id":"689f6919909f04486bb028db","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":5},"profile":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/b4488c294a971e46e2c31019c39457f1f5653e1b52334bfc6f18a00b3842a7ab.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/689f6919909f04486bb028db-1755277710119.jpeg"}},"verified":false,"views":1702,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"publi